{
  "esm": "1.1.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "RtrnAggregateLeaf",
    "description": "Identical to `rtrn_const.esm` except that the table is read through an `aggregate` wrapper — the spelling the issue #207 reporter found already worked. The two leaves are semantically the same table; only the fold timing differs, which is exactly what must not change the answer. Its inline test moved to the mounting document: esm-spec §6.6 — a mounted component's tests do not cross the mount edge (#214), and standalone this leaf's own default T = 161 gathers 20, not the coupled 40.",
